    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogueAbigail",
      "key": "Neutral_6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I wonder how the old shop is doing? I should visit my parents again soon.",
      "translation": "Zajímalo by mě, jak se daří starému obchodu. Měla bych zase brzy navštívit rodiče.",
      "sourceSHA256": "f628a5bbf20ff1b10e70b610e76eeae9ebf6e1664df1aa3595bf12acff8bc70b",
